        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1748_6435.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freündtlich</unclear> etc.
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ob</unclear> wir gleichwol den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zwüschet</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Hannß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Bisegger</unclear></persName>,
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">einen</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwer</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gorius</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Dolders</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vogtkind</unclear>,
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andren</unclear> teils, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angesetzte</unclear> tag, durch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> Ges-
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andte</unclear> nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">koennen</unclear> besuochen, wie aber <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ges</unclear>-
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">chehen</unclear> were, so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hoechere</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geschaefft</unclear> daran
<lb n="7"/>hetten abgehalten. So haben wir jedoch nit
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">woellen</unclear> ermanglen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nochmalen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuer</unclear>-
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inneren</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zweijer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angezeigter</unclear> Puncten,
<lb n="10"/>under denen der erste, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Hannß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Bi</unclear>-
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">segger</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> verhalten und nit angezeigt
<lb n="12"/>hat, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> ihme in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bewüßter</unclear> sach,
<lb n="13"/>das recht vor <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zunemmen</unclear>, an <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zehen</unclear>
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pfund</unclear> pfenning <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verbotten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">worden</unclear>;
<lb n="15"/>anderst <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihr</unclear> die sach ohn allen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zwiiffel</unclear>
<lb n="16"/>an gebürend ort gewisen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hetten</unclear>.
<lb n="17"/>Der ander, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Bisegger</unclear></persName> fürgegeben,
<lb n="18"/>er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">im</unclear> grad <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">neher</unclear> verwandt sye, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alß</unclear>
<lb n="19"/>obgemeltes vogtkind, welches sich aber
<lb n="20"/>nit erfindet, und doch die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">urtel</unclear> daruf
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gegründet</unclear> ist. Und ob er
<lb n="22"/>gleichwol <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anjetzo</unclear> sich mit dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zube</unclear>-
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">helffen</unclear> understehen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">moechte</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> er
<lb n="24"/>der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bruoder</unclear> von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beiden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">banden</unclear>, das
<lb n="25"/>vogtkind aber allein von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">einem</unclear> band
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">od</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> were, so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gehoert</unclear> doch solches alles
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vattermag</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">für</unclear>-
<lb n="28"/>ziehen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolte</unclear>,
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1748_6436.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="29"/>anfengklich dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nideren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stab</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zueroertern</unclear>.
<lb n="30"/>Gelangt derowegen an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßer</unclear>
<lb n="31"/>freündt, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachberliches</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bitten</unclear> und er-
<lb n="32"/>suochen, Ihr <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woellet</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auß</unclear> obgehoerten ur-
<lb n="33"/>sachen in diser sach das recht von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">neüwem</unclear>
<lb n="34"/>wider <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auftuon</unclear>, und den handel für
<lb n="35"/>den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nideren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stab</unclear> zur <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eroerterung</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weyßen</unclear>,
<lb n="36"/>und das (<unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">außerhalb</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vorbehaltner</unclear>
<lb n="37"/>appellation, nach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">landtsbruch</unclear>.) ohne
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einichen</unclear> bedingten od <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verbindtlichen</unclear> prae-
<lb n="39"/>judicierlichen anhang, damit dem
<lb n="40"/>richter sein zung nit gebunden werde,
<lb n="41"/>sonder er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">liberé</unclear>, was <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihn</unclear> recht <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bedunckht</unclear>,
<lb n="42"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">urteiln</unclear> moege, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inmaßen</unclear> wir uns
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unzweifenlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vsehen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">thuond</unclear>, und
<lb n="44"/>wie ihr hieran die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">billigkeit</unclear> er-
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weißen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wirt</unclear> auch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dardurch</unclear>
<lb n="46"/>fernere <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weitleüfigkeit</unclear> (die auf den
<lb n="47"/>widrigen fall nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußbleiben</unclear> wurde,
<lb n="48"/>wir aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dieselben</unclear> lieber <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vmitten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sehen</unclear>)
<lb n="49"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">grosser</unclear> unkosten erspart, und
<lb n="50"/>wir begeren es etc.
<lb n="51"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Dat</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">d</unclear>. <origDate when="1612-02-14" resp="#ner">14. Febr. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">1612</unclear></origDate>.
<lb n="52"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">B. und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rhat</unclear></orgName> etc.
<lb n="53"/>An <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hern</unclear> Landtvogt
<lb n="54"/>zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-29" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Frowenfeld</placeName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1748_6437.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1748_6438.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="55"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">An</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hr</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">landvgt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> <origPlace ref="stadtasg-places-29" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Frawenfeld</unclear></origPlace> 14<origDate when="1622" resp="#ner">. Febr.
<lb n="56"/>1622</origDate>.
</p>
